TGIF - An X based drawing editor (sorta like Xfig, not a GIF viewer)

This ported smoothly, just sigbus stuff here and there.
It is the same stuff as the one currently on sunsite that I 'ported'
previously, just updated as a small service to the linux community.

It has been relinked for Xfree86-1.2 and the 4.3 jump libs;
both are required for TGIF to use. This will NOT
work on older version of Xfree86 (1.1 or older)

tgif expects to find startup information in /usr/X386/lib/X11/tgif
If you wish to change this, edit the Imakefile and recompile the program.
Source is included in the archive, which BTW is in gzipped format.

It can be gotten from sunsite.unc.edu:/pub/Linux/Incoming/tgif-new.tar.z

